      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The juggernaut can deploy its barrier as a bonus action, reducing its speed by 10 feet. At the end of each of its turns, the juggernaut decides which way a 150-foot cone faces and whether the cone is active. The juggernaut has three-quarters cover against attacks and effects from creatures and vehicles in the cone. Creatures of the juggernaut's choice within 5 feet of it also benefit from this cover.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
