      "_id": "hCdqq7HIQbx9m9vp",
      "name": "Greatsword (Mono-Edge, Kinetic Piston, Thrust Assist)",
      "type": "weapon",
      "img": "icons/weapons/swords/greatsword-guard-gem-blue.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Melee Weapon Attack: +11 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. Hit: 16 (3d6 + 6) slashing damage plus 5 (1d10) slashing damage. This weapon has the heavy, two-handed properties.</p><p><strong>Mono-Edge.</strong> This weapon scores a critical hit on a roll of 19 or 20, and the juggernaut rolls the Mono-Edge die one additional time on a critical hit. Once per turn, if the juggernaut reduces a creature to 0 hit points with this weapon, it can immediately make another attack with it against a different creature within reach.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Piston.</strong> Once per turn, when the juggernaut hits a creature with this weapon, it can attempt to shove that creature without using an action, making a Strength (Athletics) check contested by the target's Strength (Athletics) or Dexterity (Acrobatics) check. If the juggernaut wins, it either knocks the target prone or pushes it 5 feet away.</p><p><strong>Thrust Assist.</strong> When the juggernaut takes the Attack action, it can fire the thrusters once before one of its attacks with this weapon, moving up to 10 feet in a straight line toward a creature it can see. This movement doesn't cost speed or provoke opportunity attacks. It can't fire the thrusters while its speed is 0.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
          "book": "Technomancer's Textbook",
          "page": "187"
        },
